{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>One-In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is a psychological multiplayer horror game where voice chat, intense decisions, and immersive gameplay collide. Play with up to <strong>3 friends</strong> in twisted versions of <i>Russian Roulette</i> and <i>Blackjack</i>, where every move could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4b581607427131a1ed80a77cb04a664a.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4b581607427131a1ed80a77cb04a664a.apng?t=1753182787\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a chilling backroom away from the main bar, this mode brings tension to the max. Spin the revolver, point it, and pull the trigger. Shoot the person it lands on, or risk your own life by turning the gun on yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it\u2019s a blank, you\u2019ll be rewarded with an <strong>Ability Card</strong> that can turn the tide later in the game. There are <strong>7 unique cards</strong> to collect and use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.webm?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.mp4?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/60120d3c0db2c43d7a1f43b52aebf279.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/60120d3c0db2c43d7a1f43b52aebf279.apng?t=1753182787\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play inside a moody, immersive bar setting, with a mysterious bartender always watching. Try to beat the dealer in classic blackjack,\u00a0<strong>hit or stay</strong>, but don\u2019t get too comfortable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re the last one standing, you win. But beware: the dealer can lose his patience and unleash up to <strong>5 different abilities</strong> that mess with the game, and your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/78772e4c2a977c994eb6b11949d6ecdf.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/78772e4c2a977c994eb6b11949d6ecdf.webm?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/78772e4c2a977c994eb6b11949d6ecdf.mp4?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/78adaf81b00e62bc286fe0b22b1627c0.avif?t=1753182787\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672740?t=1753182787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/dae8a5241976b8d9e090e8333a2c755ab0944f73/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753182787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/d0227946e4c060ce2b254527043910b3907088a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753182787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/d0227946e4c060ce2b254527043910b3907088a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753182787","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game has 2 modes: Russian Roulette and Blackjack. The loser gets shot, but there\u2019s no blood or gore, just loud sound effects. You play as a robot, and everything is more stylized than realistic. There\u2019s no human violence, no sexual content, or anything like that, just intense rounds with high stakes and a dark vibe."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>One-In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is a psychological multiplayer horror game where voice chat, intense decisions, and immersive gameplay collide. Play with up to <strong>3 friends</strong> in twisted versions of <i>Russian Roulette</i> and <i>Blackjack</i>, where every move could be your last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4b581607427131a1ed80a77cb04a664a.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4b581607427131a1ed80a77cb04a664a.apng?t=1753182787\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in a chilling backroom away from the main bar, this mode brings tension to the max. Spin the revolver, point it, and pull the trigger. Shoot the person it lands on, or risk your own life by turning the gun on yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it\u2019s a blank, you\u2019ll be rewarded with an <strong>Ability Card</strong> that can turn the tide later in the game. There are <strong>7 unique cards</strong> to collect and use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.webm?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/4572d3e18c156cfc05c9d678b3d4ffd7.mp4?t=1753182787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/60120d3c0db2c43d7a1f43b52aebf279.poster.avif?t=1753182787\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672740/extras/60120d3c0db2c43d7a1f43b52aebf279.apng?t=1753182787\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play inside a moody, immersive bar setting, with a mysterious bartender always watching. Try to beat the dealer in classic blackjack,\u00a0<strong>hit or stay</strong>, but don\u2019t get too comfortable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re the last one standing, you win. But beware: the dealer can lose his patience and unleash up to <strong>5 different abilities</strong> that mess with the game, and your survival!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"